msgctxt "388"
msgid "Kiryu-san!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Thanks for waiting."
msgstr "Grazie per l'attesa."

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Wait a minute! I can't believe you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Why didn't you come alone?"
msgstr "Perché non sei venuta da sola?"

msgctxt "436"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "I'll be waiting here, so come back on your own, okay?"
msgstr "Aspetterò qui, quindi torna da solo, ok?"

msgctxt "460"
msgid "You're late! Geez, I was about to go home!"
msgstr "Sei in ritardo! Cavolo, stavo per andarmene!"

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr "Scusa."

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"I guess I'll forgive you, just this once... but you better treat me like a "
"princess today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "All right... I'll do my best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Is that you, Shiori-chan!? What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "This is my part-time job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "Your what...? And who's this guy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"He's a customer. I'm more curious about what you're doing here, Yoshie."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "Oh, I'm just picking up some food."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Cool. Well, I'm kinda busy, so if we're done here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Huh... Well, see you around, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "She a friend of yours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Not exactly. Just someone from college."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "Didn't expect to see her here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Small world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "Anyway, you wanna get going?"
msgstr "Comunque, vuoi andare?"

msgctxt "760"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Certo."

msgctxt "784"
msgid "So... Where are you taking me today?"
msgstr "Allora... dove mi porti oggi?"

msgctxt "808"
msgid "How about Kanrai for some yakiniku?"
msgstr "Andiamo da Kanrai a mangiare yakiniku?"

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"Kanrai? Heheh... that does sound pretty good. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "Okay. Let's get going!"
msgstr "Va bene, andiamo!"

msgctxt "856"
msgid "How about Kanrai for some yakiniku?"
msgstr "Andiamo da Kanrai a mangiare yakiniku?"

msgctxt "868"
