msgctxt "892"
msgid "Eh, why not? Let's get going, then."
msgstr "Eh, perché no. Andiamo, allora."

msgctxt "928"
msgid "How does Sushi Gin sound?"
msgstr "Che ne dici di Sushi Gin?"

